          "stem": "Using the multiple-angle expansion, select the correct expression for \\(\\sin^5\theta\\).",
          "hint": "Use the imaginary part of the expansion of \\((\\cos\theta+i\\sin\theta)^5\\).",
          "solution": "\\(\\frac{10\\sin\theta-5\\sin3\theta+\\sin5\theta}{16}\\)",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Expand using De Moivre.",
              "work": "\\(\\sin5\theta=5s-20s^3+16s^5\\), where \\(s=\\sin\theta\\)."
            },
            {
              "explain": "Rearrange for the fifth power.",
              "work": "\\(16s^5=\\sin5\theta-5s+20s^3.\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Use \\(\\sin3\theta=3s-4s^3\\).",
              "work": "\\(20s^3=5(3s-\\sin3\theta)\\), giving the selected identity."
