          "hint": "Use De Moivre’s theorem and the fact that |z|=1, so the reciprocal reverses the sign of the imaginary part.",
          "solution": "Sample answer: By De Moivre, zⁿ=cos(nθ)+i sin(nθ). Since |z|=1, z⁻ⁿ=cos(nθ)−i sin(nθ). Subtracting gives 2i sin(nθ).",
          "steps": [
            {
