              "work": "\\(z^n=\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta.\\"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Since z lies on the unit circle, its reciprocal has the opposite argument.",
              "work": "\\(\\frac{1}{z^n}=\\cos n\\theta-i\\sin n\\theta.\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Subtract the expressions.",
              "work": "\\(z^n-\\frac{1}{z^n}=2i\\sin n\\theta.\\)"
            }
